## Docker Compose

```yaml
services:
  backup:
    image: python:3.12-slim
    volumes:
      - ./data:/data
      - ./backup:/backup
    environment:
      TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN: ${TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN}
      TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID: ${TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID}
```

